<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<odoo>
    <record id="view_external_refund_completion_wizard" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">pos.revolut.external.refund.wizard.form</field>
        <field name="model">pos.revolut.external.refund.wizard</field>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <form string="Complete existing Revolut refund">
                <p>This workflow sends no new payment or refund. Confirm goods independently of the amount.</p>
                <group>
                    <field name="refund_id"/><field name="original_order_id"/>
                    <field name="amount"/><field name="currency_id" invisible="True"/>
                    <field name="disposition"/><field name="requires_components" invisible="True"/>
                </group>
                <p invisible="disposition != 'products'">Enter a positive quantity in Return now for each product being returned. Purchased and Already returned are read-only reference quantities.</p>
                <field name="line_ids" invisible="disposition != 'products'">
                    <list editable="bottom" create="0" delete="0">
                        <field name="original_line_id" column_invisible="True"/>
                        <field name="currency_id" column_invisible="True"/>
                        <field name="product_id"/><field name="quantity" string="Return now" width="110px"/><field name="purchased_quantity" string="Purchased"/>
                        <field name="returned_quantity" string="Already returned"/><field name="original_amount"/>
                        <field name="lot_names"/>
                    </list>
                </field>
                <div invisible="disposition != 'existing'">
                    <group>
                        <field name="return_order_id" domain="[('lines.refunded_orderline_id.order_id', '=', original_order_id), ('state', '!=', 'cancel')]" options="{'no_create': True, 'no_create_edit': True}" context="{'revolut_return_display': True}"/>
                    </group>
                    <p>Select every external refund already recorded on this return and its exact card reimbursement. Include the refund opened from the worklist. Confirm any terminal tip allocation for each refund explicitly.</p>
                    <field name="association_line_ids" nolabel="1">
                        <list editable="bottom">
                            <field name="currency_id" column_invisible="True"/>
                            <field name="payment_method_id" column_invisible="True"/>
                            <field name="requires_components" column_invisible="True"/>
                            <field name="refund_id" domain="[('origin', '=', 'external'), ('original_order_id', '=', parent.original_order_id), ('state', '!=', 'failed')]" options="{'no_create': True}"/>
                            <field name="amount"/>
                            <field name="payment_id" domain="[('pos_order_id', '=', parent.return_order_id), ('payment_method_id', '=', payment_method_id)]" options="{'no_create': True}"/>
                            <field name="base_amount" string="Base amount" readonly="not requires_components"/>
                            <field name="tip_amount" string="Terminal tip" readonly="not requires_components"/>
                        </list>
                    </field>
                </div>
                <group string="Confirm original payment components" invisible="disposition != 'products' or not requires_components">
                    <p>Confirm the base and terminal tip portions explicitly. Their sum must equal the external card refund.</p>
                    <field name="base_amount"/><field name="tip_amount"/>
                </group>
                <group invisible="disposition != 'financial'">
                    <field name="reason"/><field name="correction_move_id"/>
                    <p>A posted native correction for the exact original sale and amount is required. Leave the document empty to prepare a draft for accounting review. Ask an accountant with existing accounting access to enter and post the journal items. After posting, reopen completion and select it.</p>
                </group>
                <footer>
                    <button name="action_prepare" type="object" string="Review native work" class="btn-primary"/>
                    <button special="cancel" string="Cancel"/>
                </footer>
            </form>
        </field>
    </record>
    <record id="view_pos_order_external_refund_completion" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">pos.order.external.refund.completion</field>
        <field name="model">pos.order</field>
        <field name="inherit_id" ref="point_of_sale.view_pos_pos_form"/>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <xpath expr="//header" position="inside">
                <field name="revolut_external_refund_ids" invisible="True"/>
                <button name="action_continue_external_native_return" type="object" string="Continue in register" groups="point_of_sale.group_pos_manager" invisible="not revolut_external_refund_ids or state != 'draft'"/>
                <button name="action_validate_external_native_return" type="object" string="Validate confirmed external-refund return" groups="point_of_sale.group_pos_manager" invisible="not revolut_external_refund_ids or state != 'draft'" confirm="Validate the confirmed return using the existing card reimbursement. Native stock and accounting effects apply; no new money is requested."/>
            </xpath>
        </field>
    </record>
    <record id="view_account_move_external_refund_correction" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">account.move.external.refund.correction</field>
        <field name="model">account.move</field>
        <field name="inherit_id" ref="account.view_move_form"/>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <xpath expr="//sheet" position="inside">
                <group string="External refund correction" invisible="not revolut_external_refund_id">
                    <field name="revolut_external_refund_id"/><field name="revolut_original_order_id"/>
                    <p>Ask an accountant with existing accounting access to review this draft and enter and post its journal items. POS manager access alone does not show the Journal Items editor. Then return to the refund and complete the financial-only workflow using this posted correction.</p>
                </group>
            </xpath>
        </field>
    </record>
</odoo>
